The email lacks a clear subject line, making it difficult to understand the purpose of the email at a glance. It also lacks a formal salutation, making it appear unprofessional. The structure of the email is not coherent, with multiple topics being discussed in the same email. Additionally, the email is too long and verbose, making it difficult to read and understand.

